gold statue~
The statue was clearly made by a master, if it were not worked in gold, you
would swear the woman was in fact alive. The statue depicts a beautifull
woman dressed in strange garments from another age. In her left hand she holds
a chalice, while in her right a she grips a long, thin-bladed knife. You note
her face seems slightly drawn, as if the skin was pulled a little tighter than
normal. Her lips are slightly apart and you can see her canine teeth are
unusually long and pointed... like fangs. There is some ancient writing on the
pedestel which the statue stands upon.
