ring darkness~
Upon close examination, you see the ring is formed of a dark metal, so utterly
black as to absorb all light that falls upon it. Strangely, you can perceive
that there are eldritch runes on the surface of the ring, which some how seem
even darker than the metal of the ring itself. The runes are of unknown design
and the certain knowledge that they were not written by a human hand springs
unbidden into your mind. What ghastly creature made this ring remains unknown,
but your left in no doubt it is a talisman of tremendous power.
~
